@startuml
title RF28 — Editar logo, cores, capacete e uniformes · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "OpenSearch 2" as OpenSearch
database "S3/MinIO" as S3
Manager -> Frontend: Editar franquia
Frontend -> API: GET /clubs/{id}/identity
API -> UseCase: ClubIdentityUseCases.get(clubId, userId)
UseCase -> MySQL: club + helmet_design + uniforms + world
alt mundo de outro usuário
  API --> Frontend: 403
else senão
  MySQL --> UseCase: identidade
  UseCase --> API: ClubIdentityDto
  API --> Frontend: 200
  Frontend -> Manager: modal com prévia 3D
end
Manager -> Frontend: muda faixa e grade do capacete
Frontend -> API: POST /clubs/{id}/identity/preview
API -> UseCase: ClubIdentityUseCases.preview
UseCase --> API: {identity, violations, valid}
API --> Frontend: 200
Manager -> Frontend: Salvar
Frontend -> API: PUT /clubs/{id}/helmet {expectedVersion}
API -> UseCase: ClubIdentityUseCases.updateHelmet
UseCase -> MySQL: dono do modelo ou franquia do save
alt não pode editar / versão velha / inválido / kit clash
  UseCase -> AuditService: record(ACCESS_DENIED) quando 403
  API --> Frontend: 403 / 409 / 422 + violações
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: TX: UPDATE helmet_design (version+1)
  UseCase -> EventBus: CatalogChanged(clubId)
  EventBus -> OpenSearch: reindexa franquia
  EventBus -> Redis: DEL dashboard:{saveId}
  API --> Frontend: 200 ClubIdentityDto
  Frontend -> S3: GET decal e texturas
  Frontend -> Manager: capacete e uniformes atualizados
end
@enduml
